#!/usr/bin/env python
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-

# ====================================================================================
# ====================================================================================
# ==                                                                                ==
# ==                               Simple grid                                      ==
# ==                                                                                ==
# == Updated Simple Grid to allow modification to include major lines and also to   ==
# == display the total grid size for reference.                                     ==
# ==                                                                                ==
# ====================================================================================
# ====================================================================================
# ABOUT
# ====================================================================================
# version v1.0
# Macro developed for FreeCAD (http://www.freecadweb.org/).
# This macro toggles a configurable grid in plane XY as helper for 3D view navigation
#
# LICENSE
